      <div style="font-family:'Orbitron',ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:11px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:2.5px;color:#000;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:8px;">🎟️ OFERTA EXCLUSIVA · OUVINTE DA RÁDIO</div>
